  "description": "AutomationML Editor plugin to maintain, migrate, split, compare and quality-check AutomationML libraries: library table and inheritance tree with maintenance functions, reference migration with Auto Mapping, one file per library, structural model comparison, and a live health check against IEC 62424, IEC 62714-1 (Edition 2) and the AML Library Guideline. User interface in English and German.",
  "iconFile": "PackageIcon.png",
