  "published": "2026-09-25T09:57:08.133Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial public release.\n- Library view: library contents as table or inheritance tree, live search, selection synchronised with the AML tree; maintenance functions (sort A-Z, set missing versions to 1.0.0, remove library, clean up empty elements, create attribute type library from untyped attributes, delete revision fields) with undo/redo.\n- Migration: move references from old to new libraries, Auto Mapping (strict 1:1 or extended) with a reason per proposal, orphan detection, manual class search.\n- Split: one standalone AML file per library.\n- Compare: structural comparison with a second file - change list and side-by-side view, optional ID matching, version and SourceObjectInformation checks, jump to the element in the editor.\n- Health: live quality score with 76 rules (CAEX IEC 62424, AutomationML Edition 2 IEC 62714-1, AML Library Development Guideline), rule catalogue, positive findings, strict check, Excel export.\n- User interface in English (default) and German, switchable at any time.",
